                            <comment id="16138740" author="edshanggg" created="Wed, 23 Aug 2017 17:45:35 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;The issue was in not waiting before threads stop and closing page memory (it happens when a test fails by timeout in BPlusTreeSelfTest and its descendants).&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
