                            <comment id="16140163" author="agura" created="Thu, 24 Aug 2017 15:21:03 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=EdShangGG&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;EdShangGG&quot;&gt;EdShangGG&lt;/a&gt; Why your cycle tests &lt;tt&gt;stop&lt;/tt&gt; variable for &lt;tt&gt;true&lt;/tt&gt; value while it is initialized to &lt;tt&gt;false&lt;/tt&gt; value before test is started? It seems that cycle doesn&apos;t execute any iteration.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16140204" author="edshanggg" created="Thu, 24 Aug 2017 15:45:46 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Fixed.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
